      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i get the respect part, but some people say that kids should just understand the biological differences between boys and girls and that introducing these ideas too early might be confusing for them. how do i handle that side of it? is it better to stick to the biological facts or should i prioritize the identity stuff?",
